{# Mira interview shows — gate-2 transcript review invite. Live send is the Worker's
   inline copy (editorial-decision approve handler); keep in sync. #}
<div style="font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;color:#1a202c;line-height:1.6">
  <h2 style="color:{{ brand_color }}">Your transcript is ready</h2>
  <p>Hi {{ guest_name }},</p>
  <p>Your conversation with Mira is edited and ready. Review the transcript
  — approve it as-is, or mark anything you'd like removed:</p>
  <p><a href="{{ review_url }}" style="color:{{ brand_color }}">{{ review_url }}</a></p>
  <p>If we don't hear from you within seven days we'll take that as approval
  (we'll nudge you once at day four). You can request changes post-publish
  too.</p>
  <p>{{ sign_off }}</p>
</div>
